<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Chong Kun Dang H1 net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Chong Kun Dang H1 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				    406 vs    239</p>
<p>    Net					   1.25 vs   0.68</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 1.70 vs   1.30</p>
<p>    Turnover				   91.99 vs  65.37</p>
<p>Note - Chong Kun Dang Corp is one of South Korea's pharmaceutical makers. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
